Nikumbha glares at Sugrīva and seizes huge iron parigha --- Nikumbha whirling makes sky reel and freezes both armies --- Hanumān bares chest and stands forth against Nikumbha --- Nikumbha hurls parigha which shatters hundredfold on chest --- Hanumān staggers then crushes Nikumbha chest with vajra fist --- Nikumbha seizes and lifts Hanumān amid Rākṣasa shouts --- Carried Hanumān punches free drops and crushes Nikumbha --- Hanumān twists off roaring Nikumbha head as armies clash